OL,3,GNEWSAPrince of Wales tells villagers
OL,4,A'holistic' approach is needed to tackle
OL,5,Aflooding
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales has said a
OL,8,F"holistic" approach is needed to tackle
OL,9,Fsevere flooding, as a small Welsh
OL,10,Fvillage prepares for the upcoming storm
OL,11,Fseason.
OL,13,FResidents in Skenfrith, Monmouthshire,
OL,14,Fhave faced four major floods in the
OL,15,Fpast six years.
OL,17,FAn extreme flood last winter had a
OL,18,Fdevastating impact on the village, when
OL,19,Fthe River Monnow burst its banks after
OL,20,FStorm Claudia brought a month's worth
OL,21,Fof rain in just 24 hours to parts of
OL,22,FEngland and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
