OL,3,GNEWSAPrince of Wales tells villagers
OL,4,A'holistic' approach is needed to tackle
OL,5,Aflooding
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince William was visiting the area to
OL,8,Flearn about how communities have been
OL,9,Faffected by recent flooding and what
OL,10,Fmeasures were being taken by local
OL,11,Fauthorities and other agencies to
OL,12,Fmitigate future incidents.
